  "id": "hyperactivity",
  "term": "hyperactivity",
  "definition": "Hyperactivity refers to unusually high levels of activity that, in psychology, is often discussed as part of the hyperactivity-impulsivity pattern seen in attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder. It is one of the symptom areas used to characterize ADHD alongside inattention and disorganization.",
